      "message": "e.g. https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main-al-dev/+/main-al-dev:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/stack/gatt/gatt_attr.cc `rsp_needed` could be false for write request.",
